From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 23:38:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: implement GPU geometry shaders and streams

Lower application geometry shaders through the shared GPU poly pipeline, including multi-stream emission, raster stream selection, transform-feedback accounting, and generated-draw setup. Keep primitive assembly, counting, prefix sums, and rasterization entirely on the GPU for direct, indexed, indirect, restart, tessellation, and invocation paths.
